{"dur": 50.252, "lines": [{"shot": "ride", "s": 0.3, "e": 3.23, "text": "Kids be acing tests like they have a private tutor,"}, {"shot": "ride", "s": 3.48, "e": 4.353, "text": "then ask you:"}, {"shot": "eyes", "s": 4.653, "e": 6.142, "text": "\"How did you know I had a tutor?\""}, {"shot": "track", "s": 6.592, "e": 7.562, "text": "I don't know bro."}, {"shot": "track", "s": 7.762, "e": 9.073, "text": "You skipped every lecture,"}, {"shot": "track", "s": 9.223, "e": 10.449, "text": "played games all week,"}, {"shot": "wide", "s": 10.649, "e": 11.71, "text": "and then came home"}, {"shot": "wide", "s": 11.86, "e": 14.637, "text": "still acing the test like you read the whole textbook."}, {"shot": "fall", "s": 14.837, "e": 16.337, "text": ""}, {"shot": "sky", "s": 16.337, "e": 17.933, "text": "Having a tutor must be nice."}, {"shot": "sky", "s": 18.233, "e": 19.577, "text": "I wish I could have a tutor,"}, {"shot": "sky2", "s": 19.777, "e": 20.579, "text": "but I can't,"}, {"shot": "sky2", "s": 20.729, "e": 22.214, "text": "because I spent all my money"}, {"shot": "toss", "s": 22.314, "e": 23.745, "text": "on some designer hoodie."}, {"shot": "phone", "s": 24.095, "e": 26.08, "text": "Which is why I use Unspool instead."}, {"shot": "mech", "s": 26.38, "e": 29.98, "text": ""}, {"shot": "demo", "s": 29.98, "e": 33.607, "text": "It turns my notes into reels that teach just as well as a tutor."}, {"shot": "demo", "s": 33.857, "e": 35.719, "text": "But instead of $80 an hour,"}, {"shot": "demo", "s": 35.869, "e": 37.589, "text": "it only costs $4 a week."}, {"shot": "fly", "s": 37.989, "e": 41.281, "text": "Uploading your notes to some random AI is scary as hell."}, {"shot": "eyes2", "s": 41.531, "e": 43.63, "text": "That's why your first document is free."}, {"shot": "eyes2", "s": 43.83, "e": 45.241, "text": "If you don't like the reels,"}, {"shot": "mclose", "s": 45.391, "e": 46.952, "text": "there's no risk from your side."}, {"shot": "end", "s": 47.452, "e": 50.252, "t